You'd better be resourceful.

http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/gazetteer/quest/rog.html#goal

ideas:
* various ways of level-teleporting (cursed/confused scroll, some 
artifacts...)
* cursed potion of gain level
* polyself to gain phase ability (xorn, earth elemental...)

> I'm a little worried...

If you have no resources yet, don't despair. See that you don't have 
anything that will increase your hunger rate. Then you can wait for a 
very long time without problems, as long as you haven't angered your 
god. Monsters will be generated with items that will help you out of the 
situation, but it might take some time. Probably the best chance is for 
a scroll of teleport to turn up cursed, or that you have some way of 
getting confused (*save* some foodstuff that can do this if you already 
have it). To increase the chances of monsters getting generated in your 
area, try to make as little of it as possible viewable for your 
character, I *think* a blindfold/towel helps with this. Don't pray for 
food until fainting - one angry god and you're starving fast.

Good Luck!

